00:00:26.655 --> 00:00:28.146
- Write down everything you want to do.

00:00:28.146 --> 00:00:29.725
And I don't mean crazy like I want to be

00:00:29.725 --> 00:00:32.411
the Prince of Brunei, I'm going
to have a base on the moon.

00:00:32.411 --> 00:00:33.244
Shut up.

00:00:33.244 --> 00:00:34.513
