00:06:32.628 --> 00:06:36.222
- If you write your goals down
it makes all the difference.

00:06:36.222 --> 00:06:40.389
Harvard did a study in 1973,
they took the graduating class

00:06:41.787 --> 00:06:43.542
and asked them how many of them had goals,

00:06:43.542 --> 00:06:45.301
100% of them had goals.

00:06:45.301 --> 00:06:47.658
Well they asked how many
had written down their goals

00:06:47.658 --> 00:06:51.024
upon graduation, only 5% of the class had,

00:06:51.024 --> 00:06:53.697
and in 1993, 20 years
later, they followed up

00:06:53.697 --> 00:06:56.149
with the class, they
found that the 5% that had

00:06:56.149 --> 00:06:59.550
written down their goals 20
years prior upon graduating

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:02.378
were worth more financially
than the other 95%

00:07:02.378 --> 00:07:03.896
of the class put together.

00:07:03.896 --> 00:07:05.965
So I have always written my goals down

00:07:05.965 --> 00:07:08.041
about what I wanted to
achieve, and I really attribute

00:07:08.041 --> 00:07:09.856
a lot to that, and then aim high!

00:07:09.856 --> 00:07:11.265
It's really true.

00:07:11.265 --> 00:07:13.183
- So the most important thing you can do

00:07:13.183 --> 00:07:16.701
is plan your day preferably
the night before.

00:07:16.701 --> 00:07:19.038
Sit down with a piece
of paper and write down

00:07:19.038 --> 00:07:21.889
everything that you have
to do the coming day.

00:07:21.889 --> 00:07:24.580
It should be the last thing
you do at the end of the day.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:26.977
Now if for any reason you don't do this,

00:07:26.977 --> 00:07:28.852
then the first thing
you do in the morning,

00:07:28.852 --> 00:07:31.525
before you check your
email, your phone calls,

00:07:31.525 --> 00:07:34.207
newspapers, first thing
you do in the morning

00:07:34.207 --> 00:07:38.089
is make a list of everything
that you have to do that day.

00:07:38.089 --> 00:07:41.348
Once you have a list, you
have a track to run on.

00:07:41.348 --> 00:07:44.113
Writing down a list
clarifies your thinking.

00:07:44.113 --> 00:07:47.694
Writing down a list forces you
to think at a higher level.

00:07:47.694 --> 00:07:49.778
If you are working from
a list you increase

00:07:49.778 --> 00:07:54.081
your productivity and
output by 25% the first day.

00:07:54.081 --> 00:07:56.660
All successful people work from lists,

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:00.232
and all successful people,
with regard to their projects,

00:08:00.232 --> 00:08:01.978
work from checklists.

00:08:01.978 --> 00:08:05.063
A checklist is a list of
everything organized in sequence,

00:08:05.063 --> 00:08:06.779
and you go down the checklist.

